      "answer": "The customer whose issue started after the 2026-02-20 taxonomy rollout is Pioneer Freight Solutions. They experienced search relevance regression caused by the taxonomy change. To get them comfortable with renewal, the proposed proof plan included a technical remediation plan involving schema registry check, rebuilding index weights, backfilling enrichment, and rules tuning, with a proposed 6-week remediation timeline [art_8b0063fbb3cb, art_a504e4c5b6f8].",
