      "answer": "Among the North America West Event Nexus accounts, the following are dealing with taxonomy/search semantics problems: Arcadia Cloudworks, BlueHarbor Logistics, CedarWind Renewables, HelioFab Systems, Pacific Health Network, and Pioneer Freight Solutions. Their issues include search relevance degradation, low-relevance matches, and misfiring runbook triggers after taxonomy updates.\n\nThe accounts dealing with duplicate-action problems are Helix Assemblies Inc., LedgerBright Analytics, LedgerPeak Software, MedLogix Distribution, Peregrine Logistics Group, and Pioneer Grid Retail LLC. Their problems involve workflow deduplication drift during cross-system handoffs, duplicate incidents, and duplicated remediation runs, often linked to idempotency key mismatches after acquisitions or system consolidations.\n\nThis classification covers all 12 North America West Event Nexus accounts as per the complete and authoritative account lookup metadata, which confirms these 12 accounts constitute the full cohort. There is no evidence of accounts outside these two problem categories or with mixed issues within this cohort [art_90991e25335f, art_8b0063fbb3cb, art_10f7e8b72e09, art_9345d5653840, art_4eccfd9dcf29, art_3ba29fe1e026, art_0ac4efa5a0ff, art_8478ccd5b200, art_2f780acc1f96, art_87b096c2c2d3, art_0927b1cbb7f4, art_f64972a66eeb; ACCOUNT_LOOKUP_COVERAGE].",
